# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Asthana et al. (2025), MNRAS 542, 2968 (arXiv:2409.15453), Fig. 3 panel F (red): mean free path at 912 A in proper Mpc (no h), z = 5.1-6.4.
#   "QSO-assisted" run: galaxies (haloes >= 1e9 Msun/h, Ndot ~ M_halo) plus faint AGN in 1% of the most massive haloes
#   (10 Myr lifetime, f_esc = 1, f_nu ~ nu^-1.7) carrying 20% of the stellar emissivity (17% of the total) from z = 10.
#   ATON-HE radiative transfer (H and He) post-processing the Sherwood-Relics 160 cMpc/h, 2x2048^3 hydro run; the total emissivity
#   is an INPUT, tuned by hand to the mean Lya transmission of Bosman et al. (2022; XQR-30) at 5 < z < 6.2; h = 0.678.
#   Read from the published vector figure (native path vertices, axes calibrated on the tick marks);
#   curve: Asthana2025_2409.15453/extracted/Asthana2025_Fig3_MFP_QSO-assisted.csv in the papers folder.
